(4006, '正直言って、君が作ったこの映画は失敗作だね。でも、一度失敗したからといって、クヨクヨしてちゃダメだよ。誰かも、「成功とは、失敗から失敗へと熱意を失うことなく進んでいける能力である」って言ってただろ？', 'To be honest, this movie you made is a flop. However, you can’t let it get you down just because you failed once. Someone said that success is the ability to go from one failure to another with no loss of enthusiasm, right?', 17, '{"Ja": "正直言って、君が作ったこの映画は失敗作だね。でも、一度失敗したからといって、クヨクヨしてちゃダメだよ。誰かも、「成功とは、失敗から失敗へと熱意を失うことなく進んでいける能力である」って言ってただろ？", "En": "To be honest, this movie you made is a flop. However, you can’t let it get you down just because you failed once. Someone said that success is the ability to go from one failure to another with no loss of enthusiasm, right?", "Level": 17, "SourceVocabulary": [{"SubjectId": 4006, "Characters": "失敗"}, {"SubjectId": 2904, "Characters": "正直"}, {"SubjectId": 2838, "Characters": "言う"}, {"SubjectId": 3005, "Characters": "君"}, {"SubjectId": 2805, "Characters": "作る"}, {"SubjectId": 9198, "Characters": "この"}, {"SubjectId": 3595, "Characters": "映画"}, {"SubjectId": 2467, "Characters": "一"}, {"SubjectId": 9180, "Characters": "する"}, {"SubjectId": 7372, "Characters": "駄目"}, {"SubjectId": 6653, "Characters": "誰"}, {"SubjectId": 3253, "Characters": "成功"}, {"SubjectId": 2941, "Characters": "失う"}, {"SubjectId": 3082, "Characters": "事"}, {"SubjectId": 3177, "Characters": "進む"}, {"SubjectId": 2775, "Characters": "行く"}, {"SubjectId": 3722, "Characters": "能力"}, {"SubjectId": 2868, "Characters": "有る"}], "KanjiInSentence": [{"SubjectId": 488, "Characters": "正"}, {"SubjectId": 630, "Characters": "直"}, {"SubjectId": 593, "Characters": "言"}, {"SubjectId": 682, "Characters": "君"}, {"SubjectId": 584, "Characters": "作"}, {"SubjectId": 893, "Characters": "映"}, {"SubjectId": 629, "Characters": "画"}, {"SubjectId": 654, "Characters": "失"}, {"SubjectId": 1004, "Characters": "敗"}, {"SubjectId": 440, "Characters": "一"}, {"SubjectId": 725, "Characters": "度"}, {"SubjectId": 1837, "Characters": "誰"}, {"SubjectId": 780, "Characters": "成"}, {"SubjectId": 806