(8711, '外国人が留学で日本の高等学校に入学する場合、20才以下かつ教育機関において1年以上の日本語教育、もしくは日本語による教育を受けている必要があります。 ', 'If a foreigner wishes to enroll in a Japanese high school for study abroad, they need to be twenty years old or younger and to have received at least one year of Japanese language education at an educational institution, or to have been educated in Japanese for at least one year.', 20, '{"Ja": "外国人が留学で日本の高等学校に入学する場合、20才以下かつ教育機関において1年以上の日本語教育、もしくは日本語による教育を受けている必要があります。 ", "En": "If a foreigner wishes to enroll in a Japanese high school for study abroad, they need to be twenty years old or younger and to have received at least one year of Japanese language education at an educational institution, or to have been educated in Japanese for at least one year.", "Level": 20, "SourceVocabulary": [{"SubjectId": 8711, "Characters": "高等学校"}, {"SubjectId": 2886, "Characters": "外国"}, {"SubjectId": 2887, "Characters": "外国人"}, {"SubjectId": 3852, "Characters": "留学"}, {"SubjectId": 2570, "Characters": "日本"}, {"SubjectId": 7703, "Characters": "高等"}, {"SubjectId": 2951, "Characters": "学校"}, {"SubjectId": 2790, "Characters": "入学"}, {"SubjectId": 9180, "Characters": "する"}, {"SubjectId": 3034, "Characters": "場合"}, {"SubjectId": 3286, "Characters": "教育"}, {"SubjectId": 3413, "Characters": "年"}, {"SubjectId": 3091, "Characters": "受ける"}, {"SubjectId": 4885, "Characters": "居る"}, {"SubjectId": 3154, "Characters": "必要"}, {"SubjectId": 2868, "Characters": "有る"}], "KanjiInSentence": [{"SubjectId": 521, "Characters": "外"}, {"SubjectId": 621, "Characters": "国"}, {"SubjectId": 444, "Characters": "人"}, {"SubjectId": 986, "Characters": "留"}, {"SubjectId": 599, "Characters": "学"}, {"SubjectId": 476, "Characters": "日"}, {"SubjectId": 487, "Characters": "本"}, {"SubjectId": 666, "Characters": "高"}, {"SubjectId": 1037, "Characters": "等"}, {"SubjectId": 658, "Characters": "校"}, {"SubjectId": 445, "Characters": "入"}, {"SubjectId": 694, "Characters": "場"}, {"SubjectId": 852, "Characters": "合"}, {"SubjectId": 468, "Charact