(4961, '病院から突然、何百人もの赤毛の人々が出てきました。その中の一人に話しかけると、赤毛の人に対する大きな医学実験があったと言われました。', 'Suddenly, hundreds of red-haired people came out of the hospital. When I spoke to one of them, I was told there had been a large medical experiment involving red-haired individuals.', 23, '{"Ja": "病院から突然、何百人もの赤毛の人々が出てきました。その中の一人に話しかけると、赤毛の人に対する大きな医学実験があったと言われました。", "En": "Suddenly, hundreds of red-haired people came out of the hospital. When I spoke to one of them, I was told there had been a large medical experiment involving red-haired individuals.", "Level": 23, "SourceVocabulary": [{"SubjectId": 4961, "Characters": "突然"}, {"SubjectId": 3165, "Characters": "病院"}, {"SubjectId": 7517, "Characters": "人々"}, {"SubjectId": 2557, "Characters": "出る"}, {"SubjectId": 2824, "Characters": "来る"}, {"SubjectId": 9205, "Characters": "その"}, {"SubjectId": 2520, "Characters": "中"}, {"SubjectId": 2477, "Characters": "一人"}, {"SubjectId": 2475, "Characters": "人"}, {"SubjectId": 3007, "Characters": "対する"}, {"SubjectId": 3002, "Characters": "医学"}, {"SubjectId": 4164, "Characters": "実験"}, {"SubjectId": 2868, "Characters": "有る"}, {"SubjectId": 2838, "Characters": "言う"}], "KanjiInSentence": [{"SubjectId": 773, "Characters": "病"}, {"SubjectId": 744, "Characters": "院"}, {"SubjectId": 1304, "Characters": "突"}, {"SubjectId": 881, "Characters": "然"}, {"SubjectId": 582, "Characters": "何"}, {"SubjectId": 549, "Characters": "百"}, {"SubjectId": 444, "Characters": "人"}, {"SubjectId": 560, "Characters": "赤"}, {"SubjectId": 513, "Characters": "毛"}, {"SubjectId": 483, "Characters": "出"}, {"SubjectId": 469, "Characters": "中"}, {"SubjectId": 440, "Characters": "一"}, {"SubjectId": 705, "Characters": "話"}, {"SubjectId": 683, "Characters": "対"}, {"SubjectId": 453, "Characters": "大"}, {"SubjectId": 681, "Characters": "医"}, {"SubjectId": 599, "Characters": "学"}, {"SubjectId": 715, "Characters": "実"}, {"SubjectId": 1048, "Characters": "験"}, {"SubjectId": 593, "Characters": "言"}], "Morphemes": [{"SubjectId": 3165, "CombinedForm": null